@startuml
title 用户举报内容及管理员处理通讯图

' 设置样式：使用直角线，白色背景
skinparam linestyle ortho
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor Black
}

' 1. 定义参与交互的对象
object ":AI" as AI
object ":User" as User
object ":ReportUI" as UI
object ":ReportController" as Ctrl
object ":ReportDB" as DB
object ":Admin" as Admin
object ":ContentManager" as ContentMgr
object ":NotificationSystem" as Notify

' 2. 布局辅助 (隐藏线条调整位置)
' 强制 ContentMgr 和 Notify 在 Ctrl 的上方或右侧
ContentMgr -[hidden]down- Notify
Notify -[hidden]down- Ctrl

' 3. 定义链接 (Links) 与 消息 (Messages)

' [左侧] 用户阶段：提交举报
' User -> UI
User -right- UI : 1: selectReportedTarget(targetId, type) > \n 2: inputReportReason(reason) > \n 8: showReportSuccess(reportId) <

' UI -> Controller
UI -right- Ctrl : 3: submitReport(userId, targetId, type, reason) >
AI -right- Ctrl : 4: autoAnalyzeReportContent(reason) >

' [下方] 数据持久化
' Controller <-> DB
Ctrl -down- DB : 4: saveReportRecord(info) > \n 6: returnReportResult(reportId) < \n 12: updateReportStatus(reportId, status) >

' [下方] 数据库自处理
DB -right- DB : 5: autoFilterOrMark()

' [中心] 控制器内部逻辑：推送到管理员队列
Ctrl -left- Ctrl : 7: pushReportToAdminQueue(reportId)

' [右侧] 管理员阶段：处理举报
' Admin <-> Controller
' 步骤9由管理员发起，步骤14是处理结果反馈
Admin -left- Ctrl : 9: viewReportedDetails(reportId) > \n 10: judgeViolation(reportId, decision) > \n 14: showProcessResult(reportId) <

' [上方/右上方] 执行处罚与通知
Ctrl -up- ContentMgr : 11: executeProcessing(targetId, action) >
Ctrl -up- Notify : 13: sendProcessNotification(reportId, userId, targetUserId) >

@enduml